# Tone channels: sweep on / off, duties, two wave patterns, noise periods, even pitch, length, envelope phases, pan.
TRACK
VOLUME 120
PROGRAM 9
NOTE 24 c4 v127
WAIT 30
PROGRAM 10
NOTE 24 e4 v127
WAIT 30
SWEEP 0x47
NOTE 24 g4 v127
WAIT 30
PAN 0
NOTE 12 c5 v127
WAIT 12
PAN 127
NOTE 12 c5 v127
WAIT 12
PAN 64
END
TRACK
VOLUME 120
PROGRAM 11
NOTE 24 c4 v127
WAIT 40
PROGRAM 12
NOTE 24 cs4 v127
WAIT 40
TONE_LENGTH 5
NOTE 24 d4 v127
WAIT 40
PROGRAM 11
NOTE 12 c1 v127
WAIT 12
NOTE 12 c9 v127
WAIT 12
END
TRACK
VOLUME 120
PROGRAM 13
NOTE 24 c4 v127
WAIT 30
PROGRAM 14
NOTE 24 c4 v127
WAIT 30
PROGRAM 13
NOTE 24 g4 v127
WAIT 30
NOTE 0 a4 v60
WAIT 20
NOTE_OFF
WAIT 30
END
TRACK
VOLUME 120
PROGRAM 15
NOTE 24 c4 v127
WAIT 30
PROGRAM 16
NOTE 24 c5 v127
WAIT 30
NOTE 12 c1 v127
WAIT 12
NOTE 12 c9 v127
WAIT 12
END
